cern online.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-01-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','comparison','비교','남과 자신을 비교하게 되는 문제를 말할 때 좋아요.','comparison online can hurt self-image.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-1','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','connection','연결','사람들 간의 연결을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Social media enhances connection with friends.','SOCIAL_MEDIA_VOCABULARY',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-10','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','limitation','한계','단점이나 제한점을 말할 때 써 보세요.','A clear limitation is the extra cost.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-11','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','upside','좋은 면','장점을 자연스럽게 말할 때 좋아요.','One upside is that it saves time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-2','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','distraction','방해','집중을 방해하는 것을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Social media can be a major distraction.','SOCIAL_MEDIA_VOCABULARY',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-3','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','communication','의사소통','소통 방식을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Social media improves communication globally.','SOCIAL_MEDIA_VOCABULARY',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-4','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','influence','영향력','영향력을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Influence on social media can be powerful.','SOCIAL_MEDIA_VOCABULARY',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-5','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','privacy','사생활','개인 정보 보호를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Privacy is a concern on social media.','SOCIAL_MEDIA_VOCABULARY',5,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-6','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','advantage','장점','긍정적인 면을 정리할 때 써 보세요.','One clear advantage is convenience.','BALANCE_VOCAB_EXPANSION',6,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-7','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','trade-off','상충 관계','좋은 점과 아쉬운 점이 함께 있을 때 어울립니다.','There is always some trade-off in daily use.','BALANCE_VOCAB_EXPANSION',7,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-8','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','concern','우려','부정적인 면을 부드럽게 말할 때 좋습니다.','A common concern is overdependence.','BALANCE_VOCAB_EXPANSION',8,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-item-9','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','nuance','미묘한 차이','단순한 찬반이 아니라는 뜻을 말할 때 좋아요.','There is more nuance to the issue than it seems.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:02'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','connection','연결','사람들과 쉽게 이어지는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','Social media creates a sense of connection.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','followers','팔로워','사람들과의 공개적인 연결을 말할 때 자연스럽습니다.','Some users care a lot about followers.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','communication','소통','연락과 대화가 쉬워지는 점을 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','Communication is much faster online.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','distraction','산만함','집중을 깨는 단점을 말할 때 바로 쓸 수 있어요.','Distraction is a big part of social media.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','privacy','사생활','개인 정보가 드러나는 걱정을 말할 때 유용해요.','Privacy matters a lot on social media.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','comparison','비교','다른 사람과 자신을 비교하게 되는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','Comparison can make people feel worse.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','smartphone','스마트폰','소셜미디어를 쓰는 대표적인 기기를 말할 때 좋아요.','I use social media mostly on my smartphone.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','app','앱','인스타나 틱톡 같은 서비스 자체를 떠올릴 때 잘 맞아요.','The app makes it easy to scroll quickly.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','feed','피드','계속 올라오는 글 목록을 말할 때 유용해요.','My feed is full of short videos.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-bal-01-2','WORD','notification','알림','계속 확인하게 만드는 요소를 말할 때 좋아요.','Notifications keep pulling me back in.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:25'),('hint-bal-01-3-item-1','hint-bal-01-3','PHRASE','on the one hand','한편으로는','대조적인 의견을 제시할 때 사용하세요.','On the one hand, social media connects us.','BALANCED_OPINION_PHRASES',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:55'),('hint-bal-01-3-item-2','hint-bal-01-3','PHRASE','on the other hand','다른 한편으로는','대조적인 의견을 제시할 때 사용하세요.','On the other hand, it can be distracting.','BALANCED_OPINION_PHRASES',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:55'),('hint-bal-01-3-item-3','hint-bal-01-3','PHRASE','overall','전반적으로','전체적인 의견을 제시할 때 사용하세요.','Overall, social media has both pros and cons.','BALANCED_OPINION_PHRASES',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:55'),('hint-bal-01-3-item-4','hint-bal-01-3','PHRASE','in daily life','일상 생활에서','일상 생활의 맥락에서 설명할 때 사용하세요.','In daily life, social media is ubiquitous.','DAILY_LIFE_PHRASES',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:55'),('hint-bal-01-4-item-1','hint-bal-01-4','PHRASE','on the one hand','한편으로는','긍정적인 측면을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','On the one hand, social media connects us with friends worldwide.','BALANCED_OPINION',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:55'),('hint-bal-01-4-item-2','hint-bal-01-4','PHRASE','on the other hand','다른 한편으로는','부정적인 측면을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','On the other hand, it can be a major distrac