ut at the same time, it can be lonely.','SIMULTANEITY',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-10-4-item-4','hint-bal-10-4','PHRASE','overall','전반적으로','전체적인 의견을 제시할 때 사용하세요.','Overall, remote work has improved my quality of life.','SUMMARY',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-11-1-item-1','hint-bal-11-1','FRAME','I think this topic has both benefits and drawbacks because ...','인공지능은 교육을 눈에 띄게 변화시키고 있다.','AI가 교육에 미치는 영향을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','I think this topic has both benefits and drawbacks because it can help in some ways while still causing problems in others.','AI_IMPACT',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 05:13:15'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','learning','학습','공부 전반에 미치는 변화를 말할 때 가장 기본이에요.','ai is changing how students approach learning.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','feedback','피드백','바로바로 알려주는 도움을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','instant feedback can help students improve faster.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','access','접근성','자료나 도움을 더 쉽게 얻는 점을 말할 때 좋아요.','ai can improve access to learning materials.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','cheating','부정행위','우려되는 문제를 직접 말할 때 가장 분명해요.','cheating is one concern in ai education.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','efficiency','효율성','같은 시간에 더 많은 일을 하는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','efficiency is one reason teachers use ai.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-11-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-bal-11-2','WORD','tutor','과외 선생님','개인 맞춤 도움을 떠올리게 할 때 잘 맞아요.','ai can act like a tutor for some students.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'