22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','reviews','후기, 리뷰','구매 전에 다른 사람 의견을 볼 수 있다는 점에 좋아요.','Reviews help buyers choose better products.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','refunds','환불','온라인 쇼핑의 불편함이나 안전 문제를 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','Refunds can reduce the risk of online buying.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','selection','선택의 폭, 상품군','오프라인보다 고를 수 있는 물건이 많다는 뜻으로 쓰기 좋아요.','The selection online is much wider than in stores.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-1','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','convenience','편리함','온라인 쇼핑의 장점을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','The convenience of online shopping is unmatched.','CONVENIENCE',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-10','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','limitation','한계','단점이나 제한점을 말할 때 써 보세요.','A clear limitation is the extra cost.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-11','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','upside','좋은 면','장점을 자연스럽게 말할 때 좋아요.','One upside is that it saves time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-2','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','delivery','배송','상품이 집으로 배달되는 과정을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Fast delivery is a key benefit of online shopping.','DELIVERY',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-3','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','impulse buying','충동 구매','계획에 없던 구매를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Impulse buying can be a downside of online shopping.','IMPULSE_BUYING',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-4','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','price','가격','상품의 비용을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Online shopping often offers better prices than physical stores.','PRICE',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-bal-16-2-item-5','hint-bal-16-2','