ing online.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','temptation','유혹, 충동','필요 없는데도 사게 되는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','Temptation can make people spend too much.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','delivery','배송','물건이 집까지 오는 과정의 핵심 단어예요.','Fast delivery is one big reason people shop online.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','reviews','후기','다른 사람이 쓴 평을 보고 결정할 때 써요.','Reviews help me decide what to buy.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','refunds','환불','사이즈나 품질이 안 맞을 때 자주 쓰는 말이에요.','Refunds make online shopping feel safer.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-bal-16-2','WORD','counterfeit','가품','온라인 쇼핑의 불안 요소를 말할 때 바로 떠올리면 좋아요.','Counterfeit goods are still a real concern.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:29'),('hint-bal-16-3-item-1','hint-bal-16-3','PHRASE','buy things online','온라인으로 물건을 사다','온라인 쇼핑을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Many people prefer to buy things online for convenience.','BUY_THINGS_ONLINE',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-3-item-2','hint-bal-16-3','PHRASE','compare prices','가격을 비교하다','최적의 가격을 찾기 위해 사용하세요.','You can easily compare prices online before purchasing.','COMPARE_PRICES',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-3-item-3','hint-bal-16-3','PHRASE','save time','시간을 절약하다','시간 절약의 장점을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Online shopping helps save time, especially for busy people.','SAVE_TIME',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-3-item-4','hint-bal-16-3','PHRASE','spend more than planned','계획보다 더 많이 쓰다','예산 초과를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','It\'s easy to spend more than planned when shopping online.','SPEND_MORE_THAN_PLANNED',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-4-item-1','hint-bal-16-4','PHRASE','one advantage is','한 가지 장점은','장점을 소개할 때 사용하세요.','One advantage is the convenience of shopping from home.','ONE_ADVANTAGE_IS',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-4-item-2','hint-bal-16-4','PHRASE','one drawback is','한 가지 단점은','단점을 소개할 때 사용하세요.','One drawback is the risk of impulse buying.','ONE_DRAWBACK_IS',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-4-item-3','hint-bal-16-4','PHRASE','for instance','예를 들어','예시를 들 때 사용하세요.','For instance, online shopping saves time and effort.','FOR_INSTANCE',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-16-4-item-4','hint-bal-16-4','PHRASE','overall','전반적으로','전체적인 결론을 내릴 때 사용하세요.','Overall, online shopping has more benefits than drawbacks.','OVERALL',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:34:56'),('hint-bal-17-1-item-1','hint-bal-17-1','FRAME','Online shopping has made daily life more convenient in many ways.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-1','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','convenience',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-2','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','delivery',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-3','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','impulse buying',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-4','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','price',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-5','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','variety',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:30:30'),('hint-bal-17-2-item-6','hint-bal-17-2','WORD','advantage','장점','긍정적인 면을 정리할 때 써 보세요.','One clear advantage is convenience.','BALANCE_VOCAB_EXPANSION',6,1,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 01:10:13'),('hint-bal-17-