 07:22:09'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','color','색','디자인 기본 요소를 말할 때 가장 바로 떠올라요.','I want to use color more carefully.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','draft','초안','처음 시안을 만든다는 뜻으로 자연스러워요.','I will make a draft before I finish the design.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','layout','배치','화면이나 종이 구성을 말할 때 좋아요.','A cleaner layout makes the design easier to read.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','spacing','간격','요소 사이의 균형을 말할 때 유용해요.','Better spacing makes the page look neater.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','typography','타이포그래피','글자 스타일을 말할 때 직접적으로 맞아요.','I want to study typography this year.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','sketching','스케치하기','처음 구상을 연습할 때 넣기 좋아요.','Sketching helps me start a design faster.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','composition','구성','전체 그림이 어떻게 보이는지 말할 때 좋아요.','Composition is a skill I want to practice more.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','contrast','대비','눈에 잘 띄게 만드는 기본 요소예요.','I need stronger contrast in my designs.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-goal-1115-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-goal-1115-2','WORD','balance','균형','디자인이 한쪽으로 치우치지 않게 말할 때 좋아요.','Balance makes the layout feel stable.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:13'),('hint-g