 말할 때 핵심이에요.','Students should learn how to make a budget.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','saving','저축','미래를 위해 돈을 모으는 습관을 말할 때 좋아요.','Saving is a basic financial skill.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','debt','빚','돈 문제의 위험을 설명할 때 아주 직접적이에요.','Debt can become a serious problem.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','credit','신용','카드나 대출 같은 실제 돈 교육에 자주 써요.','Credit is important in adult life.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','interest','이자','대출과 저축을 이해할 때 꼭 필요한 단어예요.','Interest can change how much you pay back.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','investing','투자','미래 자산 관리까지 가르칠 때 유용한 단어예요.','Investing should be taught carefully.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-1','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','budget','예산','재정 관리에서 예산의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Learning to budget is essential for financial stability.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-10','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','inclusion','포용','더 많은 사람을 포함하는 방향을 말할 때 써 보세요.','Inclusion should be part of the goal.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-11','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','transparency','투명성','운영 방식이 분명해야 한다는 뜻을 말할 때 좋아요.','Transparency builds trust over time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-2','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','saving','저축','저축의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Saving money is a crucial skill for future security.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-3','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','debt','부채','부채 관리의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Understanding debt is vital to avoid financial pitfalls.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-4','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','planning','계획 수립','재정 계획 수립의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Effective planning can prevent financial problems.','FINANCIAL_SKILLS',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-5','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','decision-making','의사 결정','재정적 의사 결정의 중요성을 논의할 때 유용합니다.','Good decision-making is crucial for financial success.','FINANCIAL_SKILLS',5,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-6','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','society','사회','사회적 맥락을 말할 때 활용해 보세요.','It matters for society as a whole.','OPINION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',6,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-7','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','impact','영향','결과나 파급효과를 말할 때 어울립니다.','Its impact can be stronger than people expect.','OPINION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',7,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-8','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','necessary','필요한','필요성이나 당위성을 말할 때 좋습니다.','I think this support is necessary.','OPINION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',8,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-item-9','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','accountability','책임성','역할과 책임을 더 분명히 말할 때 좋아요.','Public accountability is important here.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','budget','예산','돈을 어떻게 나누는지 설명할 때 기본 단어임.','Students should learn how to make a budget.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','bank accounts','은행 계좌','실생활 금융과 연결할 때 바로 활용 가능함.','Bank accounts are useful in everyday life.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','saving','저축','미래를 위해 돈을 모으는 습관을 말할 때 유용함.','Saving is a key skill for young adults.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','debt','빚','빌린 돈과 상환 부담을 말할 때 바로 쓸 수 있음.','Debt can grow fast if people are not careful.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','credit','신용','카드 사용이나 신용 점수와 연결해 쓰기 좋음.','Credit is hard to understand without practice.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','investing','투자','돈을 불리는 기본 개념으로 말할 때 좋음.','Investing should be taught with simple examples.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','students','학생들','가르치는 대상이 누구인지 분명하게 말할 때 필요함.','Students need real-world money skills.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','teachers','교사','수업을 이끄는 사람을 말할 때 자연스러움.','Teachers should explain money in simple language.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','curriculum','교육과정','학교에서 무엇을 가르칠지 말할 때 정확한 단어임.','Money lessons should be part of the curriculum.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-opin-11-2','WORD','lessons','수업','실제 수업 내용이나 시간표를 말할 때 쓰기 좋음.','Practical lessons help students learn faster.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:03'),('hint-opin-11-3-item-1','hint-opin-11-3','PHRASE','in real life','실생활에서','이 표현은 이론과 실제의 차이를 설명할 때 유용합니다.','Financial skills are essential in real life.','REAL_WORLD_APPLICATION',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-11-3-item-2','hint-opin-11-3','PHRASE','learn how to','~하는 방법을 배우다','새로운 기술이나 지식을 배우는 과정을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Students learn how to manage money effectively.','LEARNING_PROCESS',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-11-3-item-3','hint-opin-11-3','PHRASE','prepare students for','학생들을 준비시키다','학생들이 미래에 대비하도록 돕는 역할을 설명할 때 유용합니다.','Schools should prepare students for financial independence.','EDUCATIONAL_GOALS',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-11-3-item-4','hint-opin-11-3','PHRASE','make smart choices','현명한 선택을 하다','올바른 선택의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Teaching kids to make smart choices is vital.','DECISION_MAKING',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-11-4-item-1','hint-opin-11-4','FRAME','학생들에게 왜 필요한지 구체적인 상황과 함께 말해 보세요.','재정적 책임을 가르치다','학교의 교육적 책임을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Schools should teach students to handle money responsibly.','EDUCATIONAL_RESPONSIBILITY',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-12-1-item-1','hint-opin-12-1','FRAME','Schools should teach financial skills because they matter in real life.','학교는 재정 기술을 가르쳐야 한다','학교 교육의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Schools should teach financial skills because they matter in real life.','EDUCATIONAL_IMPORTANCE',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-12-2-item-1','hint-opin-12-2','WORD','budget','예산','예산 관리의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Creating a budget helps manage expenses.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-12-2-item-2','hint-opin-12-2','WORD','saving','저축','저축의 중요성을 논의할 때 유용합니다.','Saving money is a key financial skill.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-12-2-item-3','hint-opin-12-2','WORD','debt','빚','빚 관리의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Understanding debt is crucial for financial literacy.','FINANCIAL_MANAGEMENT',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-03-31 07:35:02'),('hint-opin-12-2-item-4','hint-opin-12-2','WORD','planning','계획 수립','재정 계획 수립의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요