:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-1','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','platform','플랫폼','소셜 미디어와 관련된 문맥에서 사용됩니다.','The platform needs to ensure user safety and privacy.','PLATFORM',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-10','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','inclusion','포용','더 많은 사람을 포함하는 방향을 말할 때 써 보세요.','Inclusion should be part of the goal.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-11','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','transparency','투명성','운영 방식이 분명해야 한다는 뜻을 말할 때 좋아요.','Transparency builds trust over time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-2','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','safety','안전','사용자 보호와 관련된 문맥에서 사용됩니다.','User safety should be a top priority for social media platforms.','SAFETY',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-3','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','misinformation','잘못된 정보','정보의 정확성을 논의할 때 사용됩니다.','Misinformation can spread quickly on social media platforms.','MISINFORMATION',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-4','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','moderation','조정','콘텐츠 관리와 관련된 문맥에서 사용됩니다.','Effective moderation is essential to prevent harmful content.','MODERATION',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-5','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','responsibility','책임','책임의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용됩니다.','Platforms have a responsibility to protect their users.','RESPONSIBILITY',5,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:30','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-6','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','society','사회','사회적 맥락을 말할 때 활용해 보세요.','It matters for society as a whole.','OPINION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',6,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-7','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','impact','영향','결과나 파급효과를 말할 때 어울립니다.','Its impact can be stronger than people expect.','OPINION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',7,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-opin-21-2-item-8','hint-opin-21-2','WORD','necessary','필요한','필요성이나 당위성