'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-1','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','education','교육','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Education is one lasting way to help people.','OPINION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-10','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','inclusion','포용','더 많은 사람을 포함하는 방향을 말할 때 써 보세요.','Inclusion should be part of the goal.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-11','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','transparency','투명성','운영 방식이 분명해야 한다는 뜻을 말할 때 좋아요.','Transparency builds trust over time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-2','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','trust','신뢰','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Trust grows when the role is clear.','OPINION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-3','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','resource','자원','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Good resources make long-term support possible.','OPINION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-4','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','protection','보호','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Protection is part of good public support.','OPINION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-5','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','participation','참여','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Participation becomes easier when people feel welcome.','OPINION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-item-6','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','opportunity','기회','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The right role can create new opportunities.','OPINION_BANK',6,