m-5','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','affordability','가격 부담이 적음, 감당 가능성','음식 가격과 양의 균형을 설명할 때 유용해요.','Better planning can improve affordability.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','leftovers','남은 음식','식당이 바로 활용할 수 있는 핵심 단어예요.','Restaurants can donate leftovers.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','portion sizes','1인분 양','음식을 덜 버리게 하는 구체적인 방법을 말할 때 좋아요.','Smaller portion sizes can reduce waste.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','donations','기부','남는 음식을 좋은 곳에 보내는 말을 할 때 쓰기 쉬워요.','Donations should be organized quickly.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-opinion-1118-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-opinion-1118-2','WORD','food banks','푸드뱅크, 식품 기부 기관','음식 나눔의 연결 대상로 설명하기 좋아요.','Food banks can use extra meals.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-opinion-1118-3-item-1','hint-opinion-1118-3','PHRASE','as a result','그 결과','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','As a result, trust can grow over time.','OPINION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-3-item-2','hint-opinion-1118-3','PHRASE','in my view','내 생각에는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','In my view, the role should be practical.','OPINION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-3-item-3','hint-opinion-1118-3','PHRASE','for the community','지역사회를 위해','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','It should do more for the community.','OPINION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-3-item-4','hint-opinion-1118-3','PHRASE','one important role','중요한 역할 하나는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Restaurants Reducing Food Waste 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','One important role is creating access.','OPINION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-4-item-1','hint-opinion-1118-4','FRAME','In my view, they should ...','제 생각에는 그들이 ...해야 해요.','입장을 또렷하게 정리할 때 좋아요.','In my view, they should focus on practical support.','OPINION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06');
INSERT INTO `prompt_hint_items` (`id`, `hint_id`, `item_type`, `content`, `meaning_ko`, `usage_tip_ko`, `example_en`, `expression_family`, `display_order`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('hint-opinion-1118-4-item-2','hint-opinion-1118-4','FRAME','This matters because ...','이것이 중요한 이유는 ...','이유를 한 문장으로 붙여 보세요.','This matters because daily life becomes easier when support is clear.','OPINION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-4-item-3','hint-opinion-1118-4','FRAME','A good example would be ...','좋은 예로는 ...가 있어요.','추상적인 주장에 예시를 붙여 보세요.','A good example would be a program that reaches people who are often left out.','OPINION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1118-4-item-4','hint-opinion-1118-4','FRAME','That is why I believe ...','그래서 저는 ...라고 생각해요.','결론 문장을 만들 때 좋아요.','That is why I believe the role should be more active and visible.','OPINION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-1-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-1','FRAME','I think schools teaching online safety should play a helpful role in modern society because ...','제 생각에는 온라인 안전을 가르치는 학교가 ... 해야 해요.','먼저 입장을 밝히고, 뒤에서 이유나 예시를 붙여 보세요.','I think schools teaching online safety should play a helpful role in modern society because daily life works better when support is fair and practical.','STARTER_OPINION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-24 07:57:30'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','privacy','개인정보 보호','온라인 안전의 핵심 주제로 바로 쓸 수 있어요.','Schools should teach privacy before anything else.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','passwords','비밀번호','실제 사용 습관을 말할 때 아주 직접적이에요.','Strong passwords are a basic online safety skill.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','phishing','피싱','사기 메시지와 관련해 말할 때 적합해요.','Students should learn how to spot phishing emails.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','scams','사기','위험 사례를 넓게 말할 때 자연스러워요.','Online scams can trick even careful users.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','cyberbullying','사이버 괴롭힘','학생 보호와 학교 책임을 말할 때 중요해요.','Cyberbullying can hurt students deeply.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','settings','설정','실제 기기에서 바로 바꿀 수 있는 부분을 말할 때 좋아요.','Privacy settings should be part of every online safety lesson.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','trust','신뢰','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Trust grows when the role is clear.','OPINION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-10','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','inclusion','포용','더 많은 사람을 포함하는 방향을 말할 때 써 보세요.','Inclusion should be part of the goal.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-11','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','transparency','투명성','운영 방식이 분명해야 한다는 뜻을 말할 때 좋아요.','Transparency builds trust over time.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-2','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','resource','자원','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Good resources make long-term support possible.','OPINION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-3','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','protection','보호','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Protection is part of good public support.','OPINION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-4','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','participation','참여','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Participation becomes easier when people feel welcome.','OPINION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-5','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','opportunity','기회','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The right role can create new opportunities.','OPINION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-6','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','care','돌봄','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','People notice the difference when care is practical.','OPINION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-7','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','responsibility','책임','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I think responsibility should come first.','OPINION_BANK',7,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-8','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','community','공동체','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The community benefits when people can rely on it.','OPINION_BANK',8,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-item-9','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','accountability','책임성','역할과 책임을 더 분명히 말할 때 좋아요.','Public accountability is important here.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','privacy','개인 정보 보호','온라인 안전의 가장 기본 주제로 쓰세요.','Privacy should be taught early in school.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','report buttons','신고 버튼','문제 콘텐츠를 바로 알릴 수 있는 기능으로 쓰세요.','Report buttons help stop harmful content.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','passwords','비밀번호','계정 보호의 첫걸음으로 말하면 좋습니다.','Strong passwords protect student accounts.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','phishing','피싱','가짜 링크나 메시지 예시로 바로 연결하세요.','Phishing messages can look very real.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','scams','사기','속임수 피해를 막는 교육으로 쓰기 좋습니다.','Students should learn how scams work.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','cyberbullying','사이버 괴롭힘','온라인 예절과 안전을 함께 말할 때 좋습니다.','Cyberbullying can seriously hurt students.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','settings','설정','앱이나 계정의 보안 조정으로 연결하세요.','Privacy settings should be easy to find.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','personal data','개인 데이터','이름, 사진, 위치 정보 같은 예로 설명하면 좋습니다.','Personal data should not be shared carelessly.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','account security','계정 보안','비밀번호와 함께 묶어 말하면 자연스럽습니다.','Account security is part of online safety.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-opinion-1119-2','WORD','two-factor login','이중 인증 로그인','보안을 높이는 구체적인 방법으로 넣으세요.','Two-factor login adds extra protection.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1119-3-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-3','PHRASE','in my view','내 생각에는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','In my view, the role should be practical.','OPINION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-3-item-2','hint-opinion-1119-3','PHRASE','for the community','지역사회를 위해','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','It should do more for the community.','OPINION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-3-item-3','hint-opinion-1119-3','PHRASE','one important role','중요한 역할 하나는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','One important role is creating access.','OPINION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-3-item-4','hint-opinion-1119-3','PHRASE','this matters because','이것이 중요한 이유는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Schools Teaching Online Safety 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','This matters because it affects daily life.','OPINION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-4-item-1','hint-opinion-1119-4','FRAME','In my view, they should ...','제 생각에는 그들이 ...해야 해요.','입장을 또렷하게 정리할 때 좋아요.','In my view, they should focus on practical support.','OPINION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-4-item-2','hint-opinion-1119-4','FRAME','This matters because ...','이것이 중요한 이유는 ...','이유를 한 문장으로 붙여 보세요.','This matters because daily life becomes easier when support is clear.','OPINION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-4-item-3','hint-opinion-1119-4','FRAME','A good example would be ...','좋은 예로는 ...가 있어요.','추상적인 주장에 예시를 붙여 보세요.','A good example would be a program that reaches people who are often left out.','OPINION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1119-4-item-4','hint-opinion-1119-4','FRAME','That is why I believe ...','그래서 저는 ...라고 생각해요.','결론 문장을 만들 때 좋아요.','That is why I believe the role should be more active and visible.','OPINION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1120-1-item-1','hint-opinion-1120-1','FRAME','I think local governments running heat shelters should serve people in responsible ways because ...','제 생각에는 폭염 쉼터를 운영하는 지방자치단체가 ... 해야 해요.','먼저 입장을 밝히고, 뒤에서 이유나 예시를 붙여 보세요.','I think local governments running heat shelters should serve people in responsible ways because trust grows when support is clear and practical.','STARTER_OPINION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-24 07:57:30'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','water','물','폭염 대비에서 가장 기본적인 필요를 말할 때 써요.','Heat shelters should always provide water.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','shade','그늘','더위를 피하는 공간의 핵심 요소를 말할 때 좋아요.','Shade can make a heat shelter much safer.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','beds','침대','오래 머무는 사람을 위한 현실적인 도움으로 쓸 수 있어요.','Beds are important for people who need rest.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','air conditioning','에어컨','더위를 낮추는 시설을 직접적으로 말할 때 좋아요.','Air conditioning is essential during extreme heat.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','medical care','의료 지원','위험한 건강 문제와 연결해서 말할 때 적합해요.','Medical care should be available at heat shelters.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-opinion-1120-2','WORD','transport','이동 수단','오가기 어려운 사람을 돕는 책임을 말할 때 써요.','Transport can help more people reach the shelter safely.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1120-2-