:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1122-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-opinion-1122-2','WORD','nonprofits','비영리단체들, 이익보다 목적을 중시하는 단체들','받는 쪽 주체를 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','Nonprofits need reliable help.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1122-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-opinion-1122-2','WORD','local groups','지역 단체들, 동네에서 활동하는 모임','지역 기반 활동을 말할 때 유용해요.','Local groups can post nearby events.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1122-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-opinion-1122-2','WORD','skills','기술, 잘할 수 있는 능력','일과 사람을 알맞게 맞출 때 좋아요.','Skills should match the task.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:19','2026-04-15 10:22:19'),('hint-opinion-1122-3-item-1','hint-opinion-1122-3','PHRASE','this matters because','이것이 중요한 이유는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Volunteer Matching Platforms 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','This matters because it affects daily life.','OPINION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1122-3-item-2','hint-opinion-1122-3','PHRASE','in practice','실제로는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Volunteer Matching Platforms 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','In practice, people need clear support.','OPINION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1122-3-item-3','hint-opinion-1122-3','PHRASE','as a result','그 결과','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Volunteer Matching Platforms 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','As a result, trust can grow over time.','OPINION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1122-3-item-4','hint-opinion-1122-3','PHRASE','in my view','내 생각에는','Opinion Reason 카테고리의 Volunteer Matching Platforms 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','In my view, the role should be practical.','OPINION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-opinion-1122-4-item-1','hint-opinion-1122-4','FRAME','In my view, they should ...','제 생각에는 그들이 ...해야 해요.','입장을 또렷하게 정리할 때 좋아요.','In my view, they should focus on practical support.','OPINION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-