hen I need a quiet break.','PREFERENCE_DETAIL',4,1,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 01:10:13'),('hint-pref-36-1-item-1','hint-pref-36-1','FRAME','When I want dessert, I usually choose ... because ...','상황을 먼저 말하고, 좋아하는 대상과 이유를 이어 말하는 시작 문장','질문에 바로 맞춰 경험을 시작할 때 사용하세요.','When I want dessert, I usually choose cheesecake because it feels special.','PREFERENCE_STARTER',1,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-05-12 10:14:19'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','creamy','크리미한','부드럽고 진한 디저트 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','I like creamy desserts the most.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','chewy','쫄깃한','식감이 중요한 디저트를 설명할 때 잘 맞아요.','I enjoy chewy desserts like mochi.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','topping','토핑','디저트 위에 올라가는 재료를 말할 때 바로 써요.','I love the fruit topping on it.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','portion','양','너무 많지 않은 적당한 양을 말할 때 좋아요.','I like a small portion after dinner.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','cheesecake','치즈케이크','대표적인 디저트 이름으로 바로 답하기 좋아요.','My favorite dessert is cheesecake.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','mochi','모찌','쫄깃한 식감의 디저트를 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I like mochi because it is soft and chewy.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:05'),('hint-pref-36-2-item-1','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','creamy','부드러운','Preference 카테고리의 Dessert 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I like creamy desserts after dinner.','DESSERT_TASTE',1,0,'2026-04-15 01:10:13','2026-04-15 07:22:04'),('hint-pref-36-2-item-10','hint-pref-36-2','WORD','cozy','아늑한','편안한 느낌을 말할 때 잘 어울립니다.','It feels c