k and study.','INTRO_PREF_TOOL',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-1-item-1','hint-preference-2246-1','FRAME','I usually choose or use this when ... because ...','상황과 이유를 함께 말하는 시작 문장','물건 이름만 따라 쓰지 말고, 실제 상황과 이유를 내 문장으로 바꿔 써 보세요.','I usually use this when my day feels busy because it keeps things simple.','STARTER_PREFERENCE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-1','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','comfortable','편안한','옷이나 액세서리를 좋아하는 이유로 가장 자연스러워요.','Comfortable clothes are best for long days.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-10','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','pattern','무늬','양말이나 잠옷 같은 물건 취향을 말할 때 좋아요.','I like patterns that look calm, not loud.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-2','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','soft','부드러운','천의 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','Soft fabric feels better on my skin.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-3','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','light','가벼운','매일 쓰기 편한 점을 설명할 때 유용해요.','Light shoes are easier to wear all day.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-4','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','simple','단순한','과하지 않은 스타일을 좋아할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','I like simple styles more than flashy ones.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-5','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','color','색','옷 취향을 말할 때 빠지지 않는 단어예요.','The color goes well with many outfits.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-6','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','hoodie','후드티','편한 상의를 말할 때 직접적이에요.','A hoodie feels warm and easy to wear.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-7','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','sneakers','운동화','매일 신는 신발을 말할 때 좋아요.','Sneakers are my first choice for daily wear.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-8','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','scarf','목도리','계절 액세서리를 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','A scarf makes winter outfits better.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',8,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-2-item-9','hint-preference-2246-2','WORD','umbrella','우산','실용적인 소지품 취향을 말할 수 있어요.','A small umbrella is easy to carry.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',9,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-3-item-1','hint-preference-2246-3','PHRASE','easy to wear','입기 쉽다','옷 취향의 이유를 가장 쉽게 말해 줘요.','It is easy to wear with many things.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-3-item-2','hint-preference-2246-3','PHRASE','goes with everything','어디에나 잘 어울리다','활용도가 높은 물건을 설명할 때 좋아요.','It goes with everything in my closet.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-3-item-3','hint-preference-2246-3','PHRASE','feels good all day','하루 종일 편하다','실용적인 장점을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','It feels good all day, even when I walk a lot.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-3-item-4','hint-preference-2246-3','PHRASE','not too flashy','너무 튀지 않다','차분한 스타일을 좋아할 때 좋아요.','It is not too flashy, which I like.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2246-3-item-5','hint-preference-2246-3','PHRASE','I reach for it often','자주 손이 간다','실제로 자주 쓰는 물건이라는 점을 강조할 수 있어요.','I reach for it often before going out.','INTRO_PREF_STYLE',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:48','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2247-1-item-1','hint-preference-2247-1','FRAME','I usually choose or use this when ... because ...','상황과 이유를 함께 말하는 시작 문장','물건 이름만 따라 쓰지 말고, 실제 상황과 이유를 내 문장으로 바꿔 써 보세요.','I usually use this when my day feels busy because it keeps things simple.