','조금씩 마시는 습관을 말할 때 좋아요.','I take a sip while I study.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-2','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','tumbler','텀블러','차갑거나 따뜻한 음료를 오래 보관할 때 자주 써요.','My tumbler keeps my drink cold for hours.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-3','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','refill','다시 채우다','자주 채워 마시는 습관을 말할 때 좋아요.','I refill my bottle at school.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-4','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','ice','얼음','차가운 음료 취향을 말할 때 자주 나와요.','I like a lot of ice in summer.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-5','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','lemon','레몬','물에 넣는 맛을 말할 때 간단하고 좋아요.','Lemon makes water taste fresh.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-6','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','sparkling','탄산이 있는','탄산수나 음료 취향을 말할 때 좋아요.','Sparkling water feels more refreshing to me.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-7','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','juice','주스','점심이나 간식과 함께 마시는 음료를 말할 때 좋아요.','I sometimes drink juice with lunch.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-8','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','straw','빨대','마시는 도구 취향을 말할 때 유용해요.','A reusable straw is easy to carry.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',8,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-2-item-9','hint-preference-2501-2','WORD','lid','뚜껑','새지 않는 점을 말할 때 자주 써요.','The lid closes tightly and well.','INTRO_PREF_DRINKS',9,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:40','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-preference-2501-3-item-1','hint-preference-2501-3','PHRASE','easy to carry around','들고 다니기 편하다','매일 쓰는 물건의 장점을 말할 때 좋아요.','It is easy to carry around all day.','INTRO_P