'hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','crowding','붐빔, 사람과 공간이 너무 많은 상태','줄이 꽉 차 있을 때 잘 맞아요.','Crowding makes the line feel endless.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16');
INSERT INTO `prompt_hint_items` (`id`, `hint_id`, `item_type`, `content`, `meaning_ko`, `usage_tip_ko`, `example_en`, `expression_family`, `display_order`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','restlessness','안절부절함','가만히 있기 힘들 때 써요.','Restlessness starts after a few minutes.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','queue','줄, 대기 줄','가장 바로 떠오르는 줄 관련 단어예요.','The queue was very long.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','phone','휴대폰','기다릴 때 손에 쥐기 쉬운 물건이에요.','I check my phone while I wait.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','music','음악','지루함을 덜고 싶을 때 떠올리기 좋아요.','Music helps me stay calm in line.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','book','책','기다리는 동안 시간을 보내는 데 좋아요.','I read a book in long lines.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-problem-1127-2','WORD','water','물','오래 기다릴 때 필요한 기본 물건이에요.','I carry water if the wait is long.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:16','2026-04-15 10:22:16'),('hint-problem-1127-3-item-1','hint-problem-1127-3','PHRASE','step by step','차근차근','Problem Solving 카테고리의 Patience in Long Lines 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Step by step, it becomes easier to manage.','PROBLEM_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-3-item-2','hint-problem-1127-3','PHRASE','what helps me most','나에게 가장 도움이 되는 것','Problem Solving 카테고리의 Patience in Long Lines 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','What helps me most is breaking it down.','PROBLEM_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-3-item-3','hint-problem-1127-3','PHRASE','make it manageable','감당 가능한 크기로 만들다','Problem Solving 카테고리의 Patience in Long Lines 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I try to make it manageable first.','PROBLEM_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-3-item-4','hint-problem-1127-3','PHRASE','calm down first','먼저 진정하다','Problem Solving 카테고리의 Patience in Long Lines 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I need to calm down first.','PROBLEM_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-4-item-1','hint-problem-1127-4','FRAME','When this happens, I first ...','이럴 때 저는 먼저 ...','첫 대응을 말하면 답이 구체적이 됩니다.','When this happens, I first slow down and look at the next small step.','PROBLEM_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-4-item-2','hint-problem-1127-4','FRAME','A strategy that helps me is ...','도움이 되는 방법 하나는 ...','반복해서 쓰는 대처법을 말할 때 좋아요.','A strategy that helps me is breaking the problem into smaller parts.','PROBLEM_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-4-item-3','hint-problem-1127-4','FRAME','It becomes easier when I ...','저는 ...하면 조금 더 쉬워져요.','개선 조건을 말해 보세요.','It becomes easier when I give myself a clear starting point.','PROBLEM_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-problem-1127-4-item-4','hint-problem-1127-4','FRAME','I am still learning to ...','저는 아직 ...하는 법을 배우는 중이에요.','완벽하지 않아도 성찰을 보여 줄 수 있어요.','I am still learning to react less quickly.','PROBLEM_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-prompt-intro-v2-0001-phrase-item-1','hint-prompt-intro-v2-0001-phrase','PHRASE','My name is ...','제 이름은 ...입니다','문장 안에 그대로 넣어 쓰면 자연스럽게 이어져요.','My name is Mina.','INTRO_FOUNDATION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-05-12 12:16:33','2026-05-12 12:16:33'),('hint-prompt-intro-v2-0001-phrase-item-2','hint-prompt-intro-v2-0001-phrase','PHRASE','I like my name','제 이름이 좋아요','문장 안에 그대로 넣어 쓰면 자연스럽게 이어져요.','I like my name.','INTRO_FOU