요.','I realized that success is more about happiness than wealth.','REALIZATION_PHRASES',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-01-4-item-1','hint-refl-01-4','FRAME','과거 기준, 현재 기준, 바뀐 이유를 순서대로 정리해 보세요.','처음에는, 나중에는, 결국 나는 깨달았다','변화 과정을 설명할 때 유용합니다.','At first, I thought success was wealth, but eventually, I realized it\'s happiness.','CHANGE_PROCESS_FRAMES',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-1-item-1','hint-refl-02-1','FRAME','I used to think success meant one thing, but now I see it differently.','나는 성공이 한 가지 의미라고 생각했지만, 이제는 다르게 본다','과거와 현재의 생각 차이를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','I used to think success meant one thing, but now I see it differently.','THINKING_CHANGE_FRAMES',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-1','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','success','성공','성공의 정의를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Success is not just about money, but also about personal satisfaction.','SUCCESS_TERMS',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-2','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','stability','안정','안정의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','For me, stability is a key part of success.','SUCCESS_TERMS',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-3','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','happiness','행복','행복의 중요성을 강조할 때 사용하세요.','Happiness is the ultimate measure of success.','SUCCESS_TERMS',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-4','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','achievement','성취','목표 달성의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Achievement is a significant aspect of success.','SUCCESS_TERMS',4,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-5','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','balance','균형','삶의 균형을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Balance between work and life is crucial for success.','SUCCESS_TERMS',5,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:06'),('hint-refl-02-2-item-6','hint-refl-02-2','WORD','realization','깨달음','생각이 바뀌게 된 계기를 말할 때 써 보세요.','That experience led to an important realization.','REFLECTION_VOCAB_EXPANSION',6,1,'2026