','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-11-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','addiction','중독','과도한 사용에 대한 생각 변화를 말할 때 좋아요.','I worry more about addiction now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-11-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','boundary','경계, 한계','소셜미디어와 생활 사이의 선을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I have learned to set a boundary.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-1','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','connection','연결','소셜 미디어의 연결성에 대해 이야기할 때 사용하세요.','Social media helps me maintain connections.','SOCIAL_MEDIA',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-10','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-11','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-2','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','pressure','압박','소셜 미디어의 압박감을 설명할 때 유용합니다.','I felt pressure to post regularly on social media.','SOCIAL_MEDIA',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-3','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','comparison','비교','소셜 미디어에서의 비교를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Social media often leads to unhealthy comparisons.','SOCIAL_MEDIA',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-4','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','information','정보','소셜 미디어에서 얻는 정보를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','I use social media to gather information quickly.','SOCIAL_MEDIA',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-5','hint-refl-11-2','WORD','boundary','경계','소셜 미디어 사용의 경계를 설명할 때 유용합니다.','Setting boundaries on social media improved my mental health.','SOCIAL_MEDIA',5,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-11-2-item-6