tion to my budget.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','debt','빚','돈의 위험과 책임을 더 크게 보게 된 변화를 말할 때 좋아요.','I understand debt much better now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','security','안정, 안전','돈의 가치를 안정과 연결해 말할 때 자연스러워요.','Money means security to me now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','priority','우선순위','돈이 삶에서 차지하는 자리를 설명할 때 좋습니다.','Money is not my top priority anymore.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-1','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','saving','저축','돈을 모으는 것에 대해 이야기할 때 사용하세요.','Saving money has become more important to me over time.','FINANCIAL_ASPECT',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-10','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-11','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-2','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','spending','소비','돈을 쓰는 것에 대해 이야기할 때 사용하세요.','I used to enjoy spending, but now I think twice before buying.','FINANCIAL_ASPECT',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-3','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','security','안전','재정적 안정에 대해 이야기할 때 사용하세요.','Financial security is now a priority for me.','FINANCIAL_ASPECT',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-16-2-item-4','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','value','가치','돈의 중요성이나 의미를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','I learned to value experiences over material things.','MONEY_VALUE',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),