D','saving','저축','예전보다 모으는 습관이 생겼다고 말할 때 좋음.','Saving matters more to me now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','spending','지출','돈을 쓰는 습관이나 패턴을 말할 때 바로 씀.','I think more carefully about spending now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','budget','예산','계획적으로 돈을 나누는 기준을 말할 때 유용함.','A budget helps me feel in control.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','debt','빚','돈의 위험을 더 크게 느끼게 된 이유로 쓰기 좋음.','Debt made me more careful with money.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','security','안정감','돈이 주는 든든함을 말할 때 자연스러움.','Now I value financial security more.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-refl-16-2','WORD','paycheck','급여','직장 생활이 돈의 의미를 바꿨다고 말할 때 좋음.','My paycheck made money feel more real.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:04','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-16-3-item-1','hint-refl-16-3','PHRASE','when I was younger','어렸을 때','과거의 생각이나 경험을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','When I was younger, I thought money was limitless.','TIME_REFERENCE',1,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:07'),('hint-refl-16-3-item-2','hint-refl-16-3','PHRASE','now I think','지금은 생각한다','현재의 생각이나 의견을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Now I think saving is more important than spending.','TIME_REFERENCE',2,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:07'),('hint-refl-16-3-item-3','hint-refl-16-3','PHRASE','be careful with','조심하다','돈을 다루는 데 주의가 필요할 때 사용하세요.','I learned to be careful with my expenses.','CAUTION',3,1,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-03-31 07:35:07'),('hint-refl-16-3-item-4','hint-refl-16-3','PHRASE','matter more to me','더 중요하다','무엇이 더 중요한지를 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Family matters more t