-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-21-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','delegation','권한 위임','예전보다 혼자 다 하기보다 맡기는 점을 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','Delegation is a key part of leadership now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-21-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','vision','비전','리더의 방향 제시를 강조하고 싶을 때 적합해요.','I see leadership as having a clear vision.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-21-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','mentorship','멘토링','배우고 성장하는 관계로 리더십을 설명할 때 좋아요.','Mentorship changed how I think about leadership.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:03','2026-04-15 10:22:04'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-1','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','leadership','리더십','리더십에 대한 의견을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Leadership is more about listening than directing.','LEADERSHIP_CONCEPT',1,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-10','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-11','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-2','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','responsibility','책임','리더십과 관련된 책임을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Responsibility is a key part of leadership.','LEADERSHIP_CONCEPT',2,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-3','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','listening','경청','리더십에서 경청의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Listening is crucial for effective leadership.','LEADERSHIP_CONCEPT',3,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-4','hint-refl-21-2','WORD','teamwork','팀워크','리더십에서 팀워크의 중요성을 설명할 때 사용하세요.','Teamwork enhances leadership effectiveness.','LEADERSHIP_CONCEPT',4,0,'2026-03-31 07:30:31','2026-04-15 07:22:03'),('hint-refl-21-2-item-5','hint-refl-2