 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1101-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1101-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1102-1','FRAME','My understanding of taking breaks has changed as I have grown because ...','예전에는 쉬는 것에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My understanding of taking breaks has changed as I have grown because experience has made me think about it more carefully.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','rest','휴식','쉬는 시간이 왜 중요한지 말할 때 가장 기본이에요.','I learned that rest matters more than I thought.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','burnout','번아웃','쉬지 않으면 생기는 문제를 말할 때 좋아요.','Breaks help me avoid burnout.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','stress','스트레스','휴식이 필요한 이유를 직접 보여 주는 단어예요.','A short break lowers stress.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','focus','집중','쉰 뒤 더 잘할 수 있는 점을 말할 때 좋아요.','Breaks improve my focus.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','energy','에너지','쉬고 나서 다시 힘이 생기는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','I need breaks to keep my energy up.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','recovery','회복','몸과 마음이 다시 돌아오는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','I see breaks as part of recovery.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-1','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','perspective','관점','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','My perspective is different now.','REFLECTION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-10','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-11','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-2','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','realize','깨닫다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Over time, I started to realize new things.','REFLECTION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-3','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','experience','경험','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','A personal experience changed my mind.','REFLECTION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-4','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','value','가치','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I value something different now.','REFLECTION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-5','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','lesson','교훈','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The lesson took time to understand.','REFLECTION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-6','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','growth','성장','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Growth often feels slow at first.','REFLECTION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-item-7','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD',