','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','stress','스트레스','휴식이 필요한 직접적인 이유로 자주 써요.','Breaks reduce stress.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','focus','집중력','짧은 휴식이 집중에 도움이 된다고 말할 수 있어요.','A short break improved my focus.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','energy','에너지, 체력','쉬고 나서 몸이 달라지는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','I need breaks to save energy.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1102-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-reflection-1102-2','WORD','exhaustion','심한 피로','휴식의 필요성을 더 강하게 보여 줄 수 있어요.','Exhaustion made me rethink breaks.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1102-3-item-1','hint-reflection-1102-3','PHRASE','now I see','지금은 보인다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Now I see the issue differently.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-3-item-2','hint-reflection-1102-3','PHRASE','over time','시간이 지나면서','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Over time, my view became more balanced.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-3-item-3','hint-reflection-1102-3','PHRASE','because of that','그 일 때문에','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Because of that, I changed my mind.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-3-item-4','hint-reflection-1102-3','PHRASE','looking back','돌이켜보면','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Taking Breaks 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Looking back, I was too narrow before.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-4-item-1','hint-reflection-1102-4','FRAME','I used to think ..., but now ...','예전에는 ...라고 생각했지만 지금은 ...','과거와 현재를 바로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1102-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1102-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1102-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1102-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-1','FRAME','My opinion of living alone has changed over time because ...','예전에는 혼자 사는 것에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My opinion of living alone has changed over time because real experience made my old ideas feel too simple.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','privacy','사생활','혼자 살 때 가장 먼저 떠오르는 장점으로 좋아요.','Privacy was one reason I liked living alone.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','independence','독립','혼자 사는 것의 큰 변화를 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','Living alone gave me more independence.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','loneliness','외로움','혼자 살 때 느낄 수 있는 어려움을 말할 때 좋아요.','I once worried about loneliness.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','freedom','자유','혼자 사는 장점을 강조할 때 바로 쓸 수 있어요.','I value the freedom of living alone.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','chores','집안일','생활의 현실적인 부분을 말할 때 좋아요.','Chores taught me a lot about living alone.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','responsibility','책임','혼자 살며 커진 의무감을 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','Living alone increased my responsibility.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','realize','깨닫다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Over time, I started to realize new things.','REFLECTION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-10','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-11','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-2','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','experience','경험','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','A personal experience changed my mind.','REFLECTION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-3','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','value','가치','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I value something different now.','REFLECTION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-4','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','lesson','교훈','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The lesson took time to understand.','REFLECTION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-5','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','growth','성장','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Growth often feels slow at first.','REFLECTION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-6','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','mindset','생각하는 방식','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','My mindset became more flexible.','REFLECTION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-7','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','awareness','자각','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','That experience brought more awareness.','REFLECTION_BANK',7,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-8','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','maturity','성숙함','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Maturity changed how I look at it.','REFLECTION_BANK',8,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13');
INSERT INTO `prompt_hint_items` (`id`, `hint_id`, `item_type`, `content`, `meaning_ko`, `usage_tip_ko`, `example_en`, `expression_family`, `display_order`, `is_active`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES ('hint-reflection-1103-2-item-9','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','hindsight','돌이켜보는 시선','지나고 나서 보이는 의미를 말할 때 좋아요.','In hindsight, I was too strict with myself.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','lonely','외로운','혼자 사는 것에 대한 첫 인상을 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','I once thought living alone was lonely.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','confidence','자신감','혼자 사는 경험이 익숙해진 결과로 말하기 좋아요.','Living alone built my confidence.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','manageable','감당할 수 있는','시간이 지나며 혼자 사는 일이 더 해볼 만하다고 느낄 때 써요.','Now it feels more manageable.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','comfortable','편안한','혼자 있는 생활에 익숙해진 변화를 보여 주기 좋아요.','Living alone became more comfortable.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','privacy','사생활, 개인 공간','혼자 살 때 가장 먼저 떠올리기 좋은 단어예요.','Privacy is a big plus for me.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','independence','독립성','혼자 살며 생기는 핵심 장점을 말할 때 좋아요.','I value independence more now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','loneliness','외로움','혼자 살 때 생길 수 있는 어려움을 직접 말해요.','Loneliness was my biggest fear.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','freedom','자유','원하는 대로 살 수 있다는 점을 강조할 때 써요.','Freedom was the best part.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','chores','집안일','혼자 살면 직접 해야 하는 일로 바로 연결돼요.','Chores take more time than I expected.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-reflection-1103-2','WORD','budget','예산, 생활비','혼자 살며 현실적으로 신경 쓰게 되는 부분이에요.','I had to manage my budget carefully.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:28'),('hint-reflection-1103-3-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-3','PHRASE','over time','시간이 지나면서','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Over time, my view became more balanced.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-3-item-2','hint-reflection-1103-3','PHRASE','because of that','그 일 때문에','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Because of that, I changed my mind.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-3-item-3','hint-reflection-1103-3','PHRASE','looking back','돌이켜보면','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Looking back, I was too narrow before.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-3-item-4','hint-reflection-1103-3','PHRASE','these days','요즘은','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Living Alone 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','These days, I value it more.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-4-item-1','hint-reflection-1103-4','FRAME','I used to think ..., but now ...','예전에는 ...라고 생각했지만 지금은 ...','과거와 현재를 바로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1103-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1103-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1103-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1103-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-1','FRAME','My view of networking has changed over time because ...','예전에는 인맥 만들기에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My view of networking has changed over time because my experiences have made me notice different things now.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','contacts','인맥','네트워크를 사람들과의 연결로 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','I used to focus on contacts more than real connections.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','connection','연결 관계','네트워킹을 단순한 만남이 아닌 관계로 말할 때 적합해요.','Now I care more about connection than numbers.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','opportunity','기회','네트워킹이 기회를 만든다는 흐름에 잘 맞아요.','Networking feels useful because it can create opportunity.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','confidence','자신감','처음엔 어색해도 익숙해지며 자신감이 생겼다고 말할 때 좋아요.','With experience, I gained more confidence at networking events.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','event','행사','네트워킹이 실제로 일어나는 장소를 말할 때 유용해요.','I met useful people at a work event last year.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','icebreaker','첫 대화 소재','네트워킹에서 대화를 시작하는 요소를 말할 때 좋아요.','A good icebreaker makes networking much easier.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','experience','경험','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','A personal experience changed my mind.','REFLECTION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-10','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-11','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-2','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','value','가치','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I value something different now.','REFLECTION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-3','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','lesson','교훈','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The lesson took time to understand.','REFLECTION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-4','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','growth','성장','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Growth often feels slow at first.','REFLECTION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-5','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','mindset','생각하는 방식','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','My mindset became more flexible.','REFLECTION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-6','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','awareness','자각','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','That experience brought more awareness.','REFLECTION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-7','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','maturity','성숙함','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Maturity changed how I look at it.','REFLECTION_BANK',7,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-8','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','rethink','다시 생각하다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I had to rethink my old view.','REFLECTION_BANK',8,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-item-9','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','hindsight','돌이켜보는 시선','지나고 나서 보이는 의미를 말할 때 좋아요.','In hindsight, I was too strict with myself.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','mindset','태도, 생각방식','네트워킹을 어떻게 바라보는지 말할 때 쓰세요.','My mindset about networking changed after a few events.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','referral','추천, 소개받기','다른 사람의 소개로 연결될 때 써요.','A referral helped me meet the right person.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','confidence','자신감','낯선 사람에게 말을 거는 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','More confidence made it easier to start a conversation.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','comfort','편안함','예전보다 덜 어색해진 느낌에 써요.','Networking feels much more comfortable now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','contacts','인맥, 연락처','네트워킹으로 생긴 사람을 말할 때 써요.','One conference gave me a few contacts.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','introductions','소개, 연결','사람을 이어 주는 소개를 말할 때 좋아요.','Good introductions opened the door to new chats.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','event','행사, 모임','네트워킹이 일어난 장소를 말할 때 써요.','I learned a lot at a career event.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','small talk','가벼운 대화','처음 만났을 때 하는 짧은 대화를 말할 때 좋아요.','Small talk used to feel awkward.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','follow-up','후속 연락','만난 뒤 이어서 연락한 행동을 말할 때 써요.','A short follow-up kept the connection alive.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-reflection-1104-2','WORD','opportunity','기회','네트워킹이 만든 좋은 결과를 말할 때 써요.','One meeting led to a job opportunity.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-24 07:57:31'),('hint-reflection-1104-3-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-3','PHRASE','because of that','그 일 때문에','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Because of that, I changed my mind.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-3-item-2','hint-reflection-1104-3','PHRASE','looking back','돌이켜보면','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Looking back, I was too narrow before.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-3-item-3','hint-reflection-1104-3','PHRASE','these days','요즘은','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','These days, I value it more.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-3-item-4','hint-reflection-1104-3','PHRASE','I used to think','예전에는 생각했다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Networking 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I used to think it was less important.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-4-item-1','hint-reflection-1104-4','FRAME','I used to think ..., but now ...','예전에는 ...라고 생각했지만 지금은 ...','과거와 현재를 바로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1104-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1104-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1104-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1104-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1105-1','FRAME','My understanding of small talk has changed as I have grown because ...','예전에는 가벼운 대화에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My understanding of small talk has changed as I have grown because experience has made me think about it more carefully.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','icebreaker','대화 시작 소재','small talk의 핵심 역할을 바로 떠올리기 좋아요.','Small talk is a simple icebreaker in new situations.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','awkwardness','어색함','처음엔 small talk가 어색하게 느껴졌다는 말에 잘 맞아요.','I used to feel awkwardness during small talk.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','chatter','가벼운 잡담','small talk의 가벼운 말하기 느낌을 살릴 때 좋아요.','Now I see small talk as friendly chatter.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','rapport','친밀한 관계','small talk가 관계를 만들거나 부드럽게 한다고 말할 때 좋아요.','Small talk can build rapport quickly.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','courtesy','예의','small talk를 사회적 예의로 보는 관점에 맞아요.','I now see small talk as a kind of courtesy.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','friendliness','친근함','small talk의 긍정적인 분위기를 말할 때 적합해요.','Small talk often shows friendliness first.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-1','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','value','가치','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I value something different now.','REFLECTION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-10','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-11','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-2','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','lesson','교훈','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The lesson took time to understand.','REFLECTION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-3','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','growth','성장','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Growth often feels slow at first.','REFLECTION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-4','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','mindset','생각하는 방식','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','My mindset became more flexible.','REFLECTION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-5','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','awareness','자각','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','That experience brought more awareness.','REFLECTION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-6','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','maturity','성숙함','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Maturity changed how I look at it.','REFLECTION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-7','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','rethink','다시 생각하다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I had to rethink my old view.','REFLECTION_BANK',7,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-item-8','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','habit','습관','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','A small habit changed the way I felt.','REFLECTION_BANK',8,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hi