n-1105-2','WORD','courtesy','예의, 공손함','작은 대화의 사회적 예절을 말할 때 잘 맞아요.','Courtesy matters in small talk.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','awkwardness','어색함','대화에서 느끼는 불편함을 말할 때 바로 쓸 수 있어요.','I used to worry about awkwardness.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-reflection-1105-2','WORD','confidence','자신감','작은 대화를 하며 생긴 자신감을 말할 때 좋아요.','Now I have more confidence in small talk.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1105-3-item-1','hint-reflection-1105-3','PHRASE','looking back','돌이켜보면','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Looking back, I was too narrow before.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-3-item-2','hint-reflection-1105-3','PHRASE','these days','요즘은','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','These days, I value it more.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-3-item-3','hint-reflection-1105-3','PHRASE','I used to think','예전에는 생각했다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I used to think it was less important.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-3-item-4','hint-reflection-1105-3','PHRASE','now I see','지금은 보인다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Small Talk 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Now I see the issue differently.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-4-item-1','hint-reflection-1105-4','FRAME','I used to think ..., but now ...','예전에는 ...라고 생각했지만 지금은 ...','과거와 현재를 바로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1105-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1105-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1105-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1105-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-1','FRAME','My opinion of asking for help has changed over time because ...','예전에는 도움 요청에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My opinion of asking for help has changed over time because real experience made my old ideas feel too simple.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','support','도움, 지지','도움을 요청하는 태도의 변화를 말할 때 가장 직접적이에요.','I now see asking for help as a form of support.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','independence','독립성','혼자 해결하려는 생각에서 바뀌었다고 말할 때 좋아요.','I used to value independence too much.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','weakness','약함, 약점','도움 요청을 약함으로 보던 생각의 변화를 표현하기 좋아요.','I no longer see help as weakness.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','trust','신뢰','도움을 구하는 데 필요한 신뢰를 말할 때 적합해요.','Asking for help can show trust in others.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','teamwork','협력','혼자가 아니라 함께 해결하는 느낌을 줄 때 좋아요.','Asking for help often improves teamwork.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:13','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','burden','부담','혼자 안고 가던 부담을 내려놓는 말에 잘 맞아요.','Sharing a problem can reduce burden.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','lesson','교훈','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The lesson took time to understand.','REFLECTION_BANK',1,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-10','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','gradual','점진적인','생각이 천천히 바뀌었다는 뜻을 말할 때 써 보세요.','The change was gradual, not sudden.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',10,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-11','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','evolving','변해 가는','생각이 계속 달라지는 과정을 말할 때 좋아요.','My view is still evolving now.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',11,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-2','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','growth','성장','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Growth often feels slow at first.','REFLECTION_BANK',2,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-3','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','mindset','생각하는 방식','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','My mindset became more flexible.','REFLECTION_BANK',3,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-4','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','awareness','자각','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','That experience brought more awareness.','REFLECTION_BANK',4,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-5','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','maturity','성숙함','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Maturity changed how I look at it.','REFLECTION_BANK',5,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-6','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','rethink','다시 생각하다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I had to rethink my old view.','REFLECTION_BANK',6,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-7','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','habit','습관','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','A small habit changed the way I felt.','REFLECTION_BANK',7,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-8','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','change','변화','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The change happened gradually.','REFLECTION_BANK',8,0,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-item-9','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','hindsight','돌이켜보는 시선','지나고 나서 보이는 의미를 말할 때 좋아요.','In hindsight, I was too strict with myself.','ACTIVE_VOCAB_038',9,0,'2026-04-15 02:19:50','2026-04-15 07:22:13'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','perspective','관점, 바라보는 시각','도움을 요청하는 생각의 변화를 말할 때 좋아요.','My perspective on asking for help has changed a lot.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',1,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-10','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','mentor','멘토, 조언자','도움을 주는 사람을 구체적으로 말할 때 좋아요.','A mentor made me less afraid to ask for help.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',10,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-2','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','mindset','생각하는 태도','도움을 보는 마음가짐을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','My mindset about help is more open now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',2,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-3','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','comfort','편안함, 부담 없음','도움을 청할 때의 편한 정도를 말할 때 좋아요.','I feel more comfort asking for help now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',3,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-4','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','support','도움, 지지','누군가에게 받는 도움을 직접 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','Asking for help can bring real support.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',4,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-5','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','trust','신뢰','도움을 요청할 때 필요한 믿음을 말할 수 있어요.','Trust makes it easier to ask for help.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',5,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-6','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','teamwork','협력, 팀으로 일함','혼자보다 함께 할 때의 장점을 말할 때 좋아요.','Help is a normal part of teamwork.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',6,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-7','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','independence','독립성, 스스로 해결하는 힘','혼자 하려는 태도와 비교할 때 유용해요.','I used to value independence too much.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',7,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-8','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','burden','부담','도움 요청이 덜어 주는 무게를 말할 때 좋아요.','A small question can remove a big burden.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',8,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-2-mixed-044-item-9','hint-reflection-1106-2','WORD','deadline','마감 시간','도움이 필요해지는 구체적 상황을 말할 때 좋아요.','A deadline can make me ask for help sooner.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:20','2026-04-15 10:22:20'),('hint-reflection-1106-3-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-3','PHRASE','these days','요즘은','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','These days, I value it more.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-3-item-2','hint-reflection-1106-3','PHRASE','I used to think','예전에는 생각했다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I used to think it was less important.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-3-item-3','hint-reflection-1106-3','PHRASE','now I see','지금은 보인다','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Now I see the issue differently.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-3-item-4','hint-reflection-1106-3','PHRASE','over time','시간이 지나면서','Change Reflection 카테고리의 Asking for Help 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','Over time, my view became more balanced.','REFLECTION_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-4-item-1','hint-reflection-1106-4','FRAME','I used to think ..., but now ...','예전에는 ...라고 생각했지만 지금은 ...','과거와 현재를 바로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1106-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1106-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1106-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1106-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1107-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1107-1','FRAME','My view of productivity has changed over time because ...','예전에는 생산성에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My view of productivity has changed over time because my experiences have made me notice different things now.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-