로 대비할 수 있어요.','I used to think speed mattered most, but now I care more about balance.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1110-4-item-2','hint-reflection-1110-4','FRAME','What changed my mind was ...','제 생각을 바꾼 것은 ...','변화의 계기를 직접 말해 보세요.','What changed my mind was a small but clear experience.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1110-4-item-3','hint-reflection-1110-4','FRAME','Over time, I realized ...','시간이 지나며 저는 ...를 깨달았어요.','차분한 성찰 문장으로 좋습니다.','Over time, I realized that I had been too narrow before.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1110-4-item-4','hint-reflection-1110-4','FRAME','Now I value ... more.','이제는 ...을 더 중요하게 여겨요.','지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1111-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1111-1','FRAME','My understanding of exercise has changed as I have grown because ...','예전에는 운동에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My understanding of exercise has changed as I have grown because experience has made me think about it more carefully.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1111-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1111-2','WORD','fitness','체력, 건강','exercise를 건강 전체와 연결해 말할 때 가장 직접적이에요.','Exercise is now about fitness, not just looks.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:21'),('hint-reflection-1111-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1111-2','WORD','stamina','지구력','운동이 체력을 키워 준다는 점을 말할 때 좋아요.','I care more about stamina than appearance now.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:21'),('hint-reflection-1111-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1111-2','WORD','routine','일과, 습관적 일정','운동을 꾸준한 일정으로 받아들이게 된 변화를 말할 때 적합해요.','Exercise became part of my daily routine.','DIRECT_REFR