,'지금의 관점을 짧게 정리해 보세요.','Now I value steadiness more.','REFLECTION_EXTRA',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-reflection-1125-1-item-1','hint-reflection-1125-1','FRAME','My view of public speaking has changed over time because ...','예전에는 사람들 앞에서 말하는 것에 대해 다르게 생각했지만, 지금은 ...','과거 생각과 지금 생각을 대비하면 답이 훨씬 선명해집니다.','My view of public speaking has changed over time because my experiences have made me notice different things now.','STARTER_REFLECTION',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 05:13:17'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-1','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','stage','무대','공개 발표의 분위기나 두려움을 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','The stage used to scare me, but now it feels less intense.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',1,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:22'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-2','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','audience','청중, 관객','사람들 앞에서 말하는 느낌을 설명할 때 자연스럽게 써요.','A bigger audience used to make me nervous.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',2,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:22'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-3','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','nerves','긴장, 불안','발표에 대한 두려움이나 자신감 변화를 말할 때 좋아요.','My nerves have gone down a lot over time.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',3,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:22'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-4','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','confidence','자신감','공개 발표에 대한 인식 변화의 핵심 단어로 잘 맞아요.','Now I feel more confidence when speaking in public.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',4,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:22'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-5','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','microphone','마이크','발표 상황을 구체적으로 떠올리게 할 때 유용해요.','Holding a microphone used to make me freeze up.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',5,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 10:22:22'),('hint-reflection-1125-2-direct-043-item-6','hint-reflection-1125-2','WORD','presentation','발표, 프레젠테이션','수업이나 일상 발표 경험을 말할 때 바로 쓸 수 있어요.','Every presentation helped me feel more prepared.','DIRECT_REFRESH_043',6,0,'2026-04-15 07:22:14','2026-04-15 1