ust the angle before I record.','DIRECT_REFRESH_044',9,1,'2026-04-15 10:22:10','2026-04-15 10:22:26'),('hint-routine-1127-3-item-1','hint-routine-1127-3','PHRASE','as part of my routine','내 루틴의 일부로','Routine 카테고리의 Before Recording a Video 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','I do it as part of my routine.','ROUTINE_PHRASE',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-3-item-2','hint-routine-1127-3','PHRASE','what helps most is','가장 도움이 되는 것은','Routine 카테고리의 Before Recording a Video 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','What helps most is the quiet start.','ROUTINE_PHRASE',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-3-item-3','hint-routine-1127-3','PHRASE','by the time I finish','다 끝낼 즈음에는','Routine 카테고리의 Before Recording a Video 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','By the time I finish, I feel calmer.','ROUTINE_PHRASE',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-3-item-4','hint-routine-1127-3','PHRASE','the part I repeat most','가장 자주 반복하는 부분','Routine 카테고리의 Before Recording a Video 질문에서 자연스럽게 써 보세요.','The part I repeat most is the simplest step.','ROUTINE_PHRASE',4,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-4-item-1','hint-routine-1127-4','FRAME','First, I ...','먼저 저는 ...','순서를 잡아 줄 때 좋아요.','First, I put away what I used.','ROUTINE_EXTRA',1,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-4-item-2','hint-routine-1127-4','FRAME','After that, I ...','그 다음에는 ...','루틴의 두 번째 단계를 덧붙일 때 좋아요.','After that, I slow down and check what comes next.','ROUTINE_EXTRA',2,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-4-item-3','hint-routine-1127-4','FRAME','The part that helps me most is ...','가장 도움이 되는 부분은 ...','루틴의 핵심 효과를 말할 때 좋아요.','The part that helps me most is the quiet start.','ROUTINE_EXTRA',3,1,'2026-04-15 02:04:06','2026-04-15 02:04:06'),('hint-routine-1127-4-item-4','hint-routine-1127-4','FRAME','This routine works for me because ...','이 루틴이 잘 맞는 이유는 ...','루틴의 이유를 붙여 보세요.','This routine w