outine-2030-3','PHRASE','get on the bus','버스에 타다','탑승 직후 하는 행동으로 자연스럽게 이어져요.','I get on the bus and stand near the door.','INTRO_ROUTINE_COMMUTE',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2030-3-item-3','hint-routine-2030-3','PHRASE','find a seat','자리를 찾다','앉아서 무엇을 하는지 설명하기 쉬워요.','I find a seat and look out the window.','INTRO_ROUTINE_COMMUTE',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2030-3-item-4','hint-routine-2030-3','PHRASE','get off the bus','버스에서 내리다','도착 후 다음 행동을 말할 때 좋아요.','I get off the bus and walk to work.','INTRO_ROUTINE_COMMUTE',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2030-3-item-5','hint-routine-2030-3','PHRASE','walk to my destination','목적지까지 걸어가다','마지막 이동 단계를 말할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','I walk to my destination with my earphones on.','INTRO_ROUTINE_COMMUTE',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-1-item-1','hint-routine-2031-1','FRAME','When I have a five-minute break, I usually ...','나는 보통 ...','평소 하는 행동을 바로 한 문장으로 시작해 보세요.','I usually do one or two simple things that fit my usual routine.','STARTER_ROUTINE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-1','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','break','휴식','짧게 쉬는 시간 자체를 말할 때 써요.','A short break helps me reset my mind.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-10','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','reset','리셋, 다시 가다듬기','기분이나 집중을 다시 잡는 느낌을 줄 때 좋아요.','A small break helps me reset.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-2','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','water','물','쉬는 시간에 가장 자주 하는 행동과 연결하기 좋아요.','I drink water during every break.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-3','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','snack','간식','가볍게 먹는 것을 말할 때 직접적이에요.','A small snack gives me more energy.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-4','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','air','공기','바깥에 잠깐 나가서 쉬는 상황을 말할 때 좋아요.','Fresh air helps me feel better.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-5','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','stretch','스트레칭','짧게 몸을 푸는 동작을 말할 때 좋아요.','A quick stretch wakes me up.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-6','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','eyes','눈','잠깐 쉬면서 눈을 쉬게 하는 흐름과 잘 맞아요.','I close my eyes for a moment.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-7','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','energy','에너지','쉬는 이유를 짧게 설명할 때 유용해요.','I need more energy in the afternoon.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-8','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','quiet','조용한','조용한 휴식을 좋아할 때 써요.','I like a quiet break when I am tired.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',8,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-2-item-9','hint-routine-2031-2','WORD','minute','분','짧은 시간을 말할 때 직접적으로 써요.','I rest for just a minute or two.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',9,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-3-item-1','hint-routine-2031-3','PHRASE','take a short break','잠깐 쉬다','짧은 휴식을 말할 때 가장 기본이 되는 표현이에요.','I take a short break after one task.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-3-item-2','hint-routine-2031-3','PHRASE','drink some water','물을 좀 마시다','쉬는 시간의 행동을 아주 쉽게 말할 수 있어요.','I drink some water and look outside.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-3-item-3','hint-routine-2031-3','PHRASE','step outside','밖으로 잠깐 나가다','공기를 쐬는 상황을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I step outside for fresh air.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-3-item-4','hint-routine-2031-3','PHRASE','stretch for a minute','1분 정도 스트레칭하다','간단한 휴식 행동으로 바로 써요.','I stretch for a minute before I sit down again.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2031-3-item-5','hint-routine-2031-3','PHRASE','go back to my seat','자리로 돌아가다','휴식이 끝난 뒤 흐름을 말할 때 좋아요.','I go back to my seat when I feel ready.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-1-item-1','hint-routine-2032-1','FRAME','When this happens, I usually ... because ...','상황을 먼저 말하고, 내가 하는 행동이나 선택의 이유를 이어 말하는 시작 문장','정답처럼 따라 쓰기보다 내 상황에 맞는 행동과 이유로 바꿔 써 보세요.','When this happens, I usually check what I need because it helps me feel ready.','STARTER_ROUTINE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:06','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-1','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','break','휴식','짧게 쉬는 시간 자체를 말할 때 써요.','A short break helps me reset my mind.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-10','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','reset','리셋, 다시 가다듬기','기분이나 집중을 다시 잡는 느낌을 줄 때 좋아요.','A small break helps me reset.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-2','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','water','물','쉬는 시간에 가장 자주 하는 행동과 연결하기 좋아요.','I drink water during every break.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-3','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','snack','간식','가볍게 먹는 것을 말할 때 직접적이에요.','A small snack gives me more energy.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-4','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','air','공기','바깥에 잠깐 나가서 쉬는 상황을 말할 때 좋아요.','Fresh air helps me feel better.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2-item-5','hint-routine-2032-2','WORD','stretch','스트레칭','짧게 몸을 푸는 동작을 말할 때 좋아요.','A quick stretch wakes me up.','INTRO_ROUTINE_BREAK',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:07','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2032-2