m-4','hint-routine-2061-3','PHRASE','check the route','경로를 확인하다','귀가 전에 길이나 교통편을 확인할 때 사용하세요.','I check the route before I go home.','INTRO_ROUTINE_GO_HOME',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2061-3-item-5','hint-routine-2061-3','PHRASE','put on my shoes','신발을 신다','밖으로 나가기 전 마지막 준비 행동을 말할 때 사용하세요.','I put on my shoes before I head home.','INTRO_ROUTINE_GO_HOME',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-1-item-1','hint-routine-2062-1','FRAME','When this happens, I usually ... because ...','상황을 먼저 말하고, 내가 하는 행동이나 선택의 이유를 이어 말하는 시작 문장','정답처럼 따라 쓰기보다 내 상황에 맞는 행동과 이유로 바꿔 써 보세요.','When this happens, I usually check what I need because it helps me feel ready.','STARTER_ROUTINE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-1','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','neighborhood','동네','집 근처에 도착한 뒤의 분위기를 말할 때 좋아요.','My neighborhood feels quiet in the evening.','INTRO_ROUTINE_HOME',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-10','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','finally','드디어','하루가 끝났다는 느낌을 줄 때 좋아요.','I finally sit down after everything is done.','INTRO_ROUTINE_HOME',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-2','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','door','문','집에 들어가는 장면을 말할 때 아주 직접적이에요.','I open the door and take a deep breath.','INTRO_ROUTINE_HOME',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-3','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','bag','가방','집에 오자마자 내려놓는 물건이라 자주 써요.','I put my bag down near the sofa.','INTRO_ROUTINE_HOME',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-4','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','shoes','신발','집에 들어온 뒤 마무리 행동을 말할 때 좋아요.','My shoes come off right away.','INTRO_ROUTINE_HOME',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:15','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2062-2-item-5','hint-routine-2062-2','WORD','lights','불','집 안 분위기를 바꾸는 첫 행동으로 자연스러워요.','I turn on the lights when I get home.','INTRO_ROUTIN