makes the room feel calm.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-10','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','late','늦은','밤이 깊어지는 상황을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I do not like staying up too late.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-2','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','sofa','소파','저녁에 쉬는 장소를 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I sit on the sofa after dinner.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-3','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','blanket','담요','편안한 저녁을 묘사할 때 좋아요.','A blanket makes me feel relaxed.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-4','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','laptop','노트북','저녁에 마무리하는 디지털 기기를 말할 때 써요.','I close my laptop before I rest.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-5','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','alarm','알람','밤에 준비하는 마지막 행동과 잘 맞아요.','I set my alarm before I sleep.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-6','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','drink','음료','따뜻한 물이나 차 아닌 음료도 넓게 표현할 수 있어요.','A warm drink helps me slow down.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-7','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','quiet','조용한','저녁에 원하는 분위기를 짧게 말해 줘요.','I like a quiet evening after a busy day.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-8','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','music','음악','편하게 쉬는 장면을 만들 때 쓰기 좋아요.','Soft music helps me relax at night.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',8,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-2-item-9','hint-routine-2091-2','WORD','screen','화면','디지털 기기 사용을 줄이는 흐름과 연결하기 쉬워요.','I try to look at screens less at night.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',9,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-3-item-1','hint-routine-2091-3','PHRASE','sit on the sofa','소파에 앉다','저녁 휴식을 말할 때 가장 쉬운 표현이에요.','I sit on the sofa and take a deep breath.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-3-item-2','hint-routine-2091-3','PHRASE','play soft music','잔잔한 음악을 틀다','편안한 분위기를 만들 때 좋아요.','I play soft music when I want to relax.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-3-item-3','hint-routine-2091-3','PHRASE','close my laptop','노트북을 닫다','하루를 마무리하는 느낌을 줄 때 좋아요.','I close my laptop before I rest.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-3-item-4','hint-routine-2091-3','PHRASE','set my alarm','알람을 맞추다','밤의 마지막 준비를 말할 때 아주 자연스러워요.','I set my alarm and charge my phone.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2091-3-item-5','hint-routine-2091-3','PHRASE','make a warm drink','따뜻한 음료를 만들다','조용한 저녁 시간을 설명할 때 쓰기 좋아요.','I make a warm drink and read a little.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2092-1-item-1','hint-routine-2092-1','FRAME','When this happens, I usually ... because ...','상황을 먼저 말하고, 내가 하는 행동이나 선택의 이유를 이어 말하는 시작 문장','정답처럼 따라 쓰기보다 내 상황에 맞는 행동과 이유로 바꿔 써 보세요.','When this happens, I usually check what I need because it helps me feel ready.','STARTER_ROUTINE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2092-2-item-1','hint-routine-2092-2','WORD','lamp','스탠드 조명','저녁 분위기를 만들 때 쓰기 좋아요.','A warm lamp makes the room feel calm.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2092-2-item-10','hint-routine-2092-2','WORD','late','늦은','밤이 깊어지는 상황을 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I do not like staying up too late.','INTRO_ROUTINE_EVENING',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:51:23','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2092-2-item-2','hint-routine-2092-2','WORD','sofa','소파','저녁에 쉬는 장소를 말할 때 자연스러워요.','I sit on