 basket at the door.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-3','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','shelf','진열대','상품을 고르는 장소를 말할 때 좋아요.','I look at the shelf for snacks.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-4','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','cashier','계산대 직원','계산할 때 만나는 사람을 말할 수 있어요.','The cashier smiles and says hello.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-5','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','receipt','영수증','계산 뒤에 받는 것을 말할 때 써요.','I keep the receipt in my bag.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-6','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','cart','카트','물건이 많을 때 쓰는 도구를 말할 때 좋아요.','I use a cart when I buy many things.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-7','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','aisle','통로','가게 안에서 움직이는 곳을 말할 때 좋아요.','I walk down the drink aisle first.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-8','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','price','가격','사는 이유를 설명할 때 자주 써요.','I check the price before I decide.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',8,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-2-item-9','hint-routine-2416-2','WORD','fridge','냉장고','집에 와서 음식을 정리할 때 자주 나와요.','Cold food goes into the fridge first.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',9,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-3-item-1','hint-routine-2416-3','PHRASE','check my list','목록을 확인하다','무언가를 빠뜨리지 않으려 할 때 자연스러워요.','I check my list before I buy anything.','INTRO_ROUTINE_SHOPPING',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:19','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2416-3-item-2','hint-routine-2416-3','PHRASE','check my wallet','지갑을 확인하다','편의점에 들어가기 전 준비 행동을 말할 때 사용하세요.','I check my wallet before I enter the convenience store.','INTRO_ROUTINE_STORE_PREP',