ause ...','상황을 먼저 말하고, 내가 하는 행동이나 선택의 이유를 이어 말하는 시작 문장','정답처럼 따라 쓰기보다 내 상황에 맞는 행동과 이유로 바꿔 써 보세요.','When this happens, I usually check what I need because it helps me feel ready.','STARTER_ROUTINE',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-1','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','sneakers','운동화','걷거나 가볍게 움직일 때 가장 자주 나와요.','I wear sneakers for a short walk.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',1,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-10','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','muscles','근육','몸이 풀리거나 뻐근한 느낌을 말할 때 좋아요.','My muscles feel better after stretching.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',10,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-2','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','mat','매트','스트레칭이나 홈 운동을 말할 때 좋아요.','I keep my mat by the wall.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',2,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-3','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','bottle','물병','운동 전후 준비를 말할 때 유용해요.','I bring a bottle of water with me.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',3,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-4','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','pace','속도','천천히 걷는지 빠르게 걷는지 말할 때 좋아요.','I keep a steady pace on my walk.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',4,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-5','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','stretch','스트레칭','짧게 몸을 푸는 행동을 가장 쉽게 말할 수 있어요.','I do a short stretch before I move.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',5,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-6','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','steps','걸음 수','걷기 양을 말할 때 자주 써요.','I count my steps on my phone.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',6,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-7','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','park','공원','가볍게 움직이는 장소를 말할 때 좋아요.','The park is close to my house.','INTRO_ROUTINE_WALK',7,0,'2026-04-22 10:52:29','2026-05-12 10:11:51'),('hint-routine-2446-2-item-8','hint-routine-2446-2','WORD','timer','타이머','짧은 운동 시간을 재는 상황에 잘 맞아요.','I set a timer for