y that cleaning job is easiest for the learner to start.','The answer gives a concrete factor such as short duration, visible scope, ready tools, low effort, familiar steps, or an immediate need that explains the ease of starting.','그 청소 일을 학습자가 시작하기 가장 쉬워하는 이유.','짧은 시간, 눈에 보이는 범위, 준비된 도구, 적은 노력, 익숙한 단계나 즉각적인 필요처럼 시작하기 쉬운 까닭을 구체적으로 설명하면 충족한다.',1),(3099,'prompt-preference-2537',4,'OPTIONAL',3,'The learner\'s emotional response before, during, or after starting that easy cleaning job.','The answer conveys a distinct feeling such as low resistance, relief, satisfaction, motivation, or calm and ties it to the identified task.','시작하기 쉬운 그 청소 일을 시작하기 전, 하는 중이나 마친 뒤의 학습자 감정.','그 작업과 연결된 부담 없음, 안도감, 만족감, 동기나 차분함 같은 뚜렷한 감정을 말하면 충족한다.',1),(3100,'prompt-preference-2537',3,'OPTIONAL',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3101,'prompt-preference-2538',1,'REQUIRED',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3102,'prompt-preference-2538',2,'REQUIRED',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3103,'prompt-preference-2538',4,'OPTIONAL',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3104,'prompt-preference-2538',3,'OPTIONAL',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3105,'prompt-preference-2539',1,'REQUIRED',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3106,'prompt-preference-2539',2,'REQUIRED',2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3107,'prompt-preference-2539',4,'OPTIONAL',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3108,'prompt-preference-2539',3,'OPTIONAL',22,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3109,'prompt-preference-2540',1,'REQUIRED',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3110,'prompt-preference-2540',2,'REQUIRED',3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3111,'prompt-preference-2540',4,'OPTIONAL',23,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3112,'prompt-preference-2540',3,'OPTIONAL',2,'A particular label or home situation that demonstrates the usefulness of labeling.','The answer gives a concrete label text, marked item, or occasion when the label guided a specific choice or action.','라벨링의 유용함을 보여 주는 구체적인 라벨이나 집 안 상황.','구체적인 라벨 문구, 표시한 물건이나 라벨 덕분에 특정 선택·행동을 한 경우를 말하면 충족한다.',1),(3113,'prompt-preference-2541',1,'REQUIRED',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0),(3114,'prompt-